{
  "choices": [
    {
      "message": {
        "content": "{\n  \"source_routes\": [\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0121\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Characterization of gut microbiota in patients with primary hepatocellular carcinoma received immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提供 HCC 患者中 Faecalibacterium 富集与 PFS 延长、Bacteroidales 富集与耐药相关的回顾性队列证据。作为肝癌特异性微生物标志物案例，用于对比其他实体瘤中同类菌属的预测价值，并提示口腔 - 肠道菌群同步变化的采样策略。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0122\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Microbial Ecosystem Therapeutics 4 (MET4) elicits treatment-specific IgG responses associated with changes in gut microbiota in immune checkpoint inhibitor recipients with advanced solid tumors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"记录 MET4 联合体干预后宿主产生特异性 IgG 及外周免疫细胞重塑的早期试验数据。提出“佐剂样菌”触发异源免疫反应的机制假说，用于阐释微生物干预如何通过体液免疫网络远程调节抗肿瘤免疫，而非仅依赖定植。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0123\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer Patients Treated with Anti-PD1 Immunotherapy Show Distinct Microbial Signatures and Metabolic Pathways According to Clinical Outcomes\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"在 NSCLC 队列中识别 Alistipes 等有益菌与 Streptococcus 等有害菌，并发现代谢通路特征预测 PD-L1 状态优于分类学。提供抗酸药使用干扰菌群并关联短 PFS 的混杂因素证据，支持药物管理对疗效的影响。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0124\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"THE MICROBIOME–HOST AXIS IN CANCER THERAPY: MECHANISMS SHAPING IMMUNOTHERAPY EFFICACY AND TREATMENT TOXICITY\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"综述肌苷通过 A2A 受体增强 Th1 分化及丁酸盐表观遗传修饰 CD8+ T 细胞的分子机制。补充瘤内微生物酶（CDA）降解化疗药物的非免疫机制，并指出性别差异与长期幸存者菌群失调的研究空白。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0125\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"376 A phase I/II study of live biotherapeutic MRx0518 in combination with pembrolizumab in patients refractory to immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"定义 ICI 继发性耐药的临床操作标准，展示单菌株活体生物制剂 MRx0518 联合 PD-1 抑制剂的试验设计。作为克服耐药的转化案例，说明当前从临床前机制向早期临床安全性验证的过渡状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0126\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"More fuel for the fire: Gut microbes and toxicity to immune agonist antibodies in cancer\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"基于小鼠模型阐明肠道微生物通过 MyD88 通路介导免疫激动剂抗体（如抗 CD40/CD137）毒性的机制，区分其与 ICI 疗效增强（STING 通路）的不同路径。警示广谱抗生素虽减毒但损害疗效的复杂性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0127\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in microsatellite unstable/mismatch repair-deficient advanced pancreatic adenocarcinoma: an AGEO European Cohort.\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提供 MSI/dMMR 胰腺癌患者对 ICI 高响应率的临床数据，作为“冷肿瘤”中特定分子亚型转化为“热肿瘤”的极端案例。用于对比不同研究中疗效差异，强调治疗时机和分子筛选对评估微生物影响的背景重要性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0128\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Harnessing the microbiome for cancer therapy\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"构建微生物组通过调节特定免疫细胞亚群（CD8+ T, MDSCs）及屏障完整性影响 ICI 疗效的概念框架。列举 FMT 和饮食干预策略，同时指出当前机制研究多基于动物模型且缺乏统一效应量数据的局限性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0129\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Relating Gut Microbiome and Its Modulating Factors to Immunotherapy in Solid Tumors: A Systematic Review\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"汇总厚壁菌门/疣微菌门与良好疗效正相关、变形菌门与不良疗效负相关的跨癌种观察证据。明确抗生素在 ICI 启动前 2 个月内使用的负面效应，并建立植物性饮食富集有益菌群的逻辑链条。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0130\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut microbiome modulates efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"梳理双歧杆菌、AKK 促进疗效与拟杆菌属结果矛盾的实证数据。详述微生物通过增强 DC 成熟、调节 Treg 分化及诱导交叉反应性 Th1 免疫的机制，区分 PD-1 与 CTLA-4 抑制剂的不同依赖路径。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0131\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"The Emerging Role of the Gut Microbiome in the Cancer Response to Immune Checkpoint Inhibitors: A Narrative Review\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"确立基线菌群组成、菌群失调及抗生素使用为影响 ICI 疗效的三大宏观维度。提供领域共识性背景，强调优化菌群作为潜在干预方向的可行性，同时指出缺乏具体分子机制细节和标准化干预方案的现状。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0132\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Human Microbiome and Its Medical Applications\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"列举 Roseburia hominis 富集与 ICI 响应正相关的证据，阐述乳酸杆菌通过 cGAS/STING 轴激活 DC 及 IFN-β产生的机制。介绍工程菌递送纳米抗体或 GM-CSF 的合成生物学策略及其临床前转化挑战。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0133\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Predictive Biomarkers and Resistance Mechanisms of Checkpoint Inhibitors in Malignant Solid Tumors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"确认 Akkermansia、Faecalibacterium 为有益标志物，Bacteroides、E. coli 为耐药相关菌。阐述微生物通过调节 IL-2/IFN-γ水平、抗原呈递及代谢产物（SCFA、脱氧胆酸）影响全身免疫的潜在路径。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0134\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Fluctuations in Gut Microbiome Composition During Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor Therapy\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提供 NSCLC 患者治疗期间菌群动态变化（波动 vs 稳定）与疗效关联的小样本证据。指出响应者中 Clostridium sensu stricto 1 增加与非响应者中 Akkermansia 减少的纵向特征，支持动态监测作为预测因子的潜力。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0135\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Impact of Proton Pump Inhibitor Use on Progression-Free and Overall Survival in Cancer Patients Undergoing Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor Therapy: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of Recent Studies\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"荟萃分析证实 PPI 使用与 ICI 治疗后 OS 缩短（HR=1.18）显著相关。提出 PPI 通过改变肠道 pH、促进条件致病菌生长及诱导 Treg 分化从而抑制抗肿瘤免疫的机制假说，强调临床药物管理的必要性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0136\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut microbiota influences the efficiency of immune checkpoint inhibitors by modulating the immune system (Review)\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"汇总 Akkermansia/Bifidobacterium 与疗效正相关及抗生素负面影响的观察数据。详述 SCFA 调节 Treg/Th17 分化及屏障完整性的机制，同时指出益生菌效果的高度菌株特异性和部分研究中的矛盾结果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0137\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut metatranscriptomics based de novo assembly reveals microbial signatures predicting immunotherapy outcomes in non-small cell lung cancer\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"利用宏转录组学发现放线菌和古菌的高转录活性与 NSCLC 短 PFS 相关，而厚壁菌代谢活跃与长 PFS 相关。揭示 DNA 修复/应激反应通路与疗效的关联，论证功能活性比静态丰度更能反映治疗响应状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0138\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"770 Analysis of gut microbiome in patients receiving adoptive T-cell therapy (ACT) across different solid tumour types\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"作为 ACT 治疗背景下微生物组变化的探索性案例，提示淋巴清除前抗生素使用对菌群的干扰。虽样本量极小且非 ICI 直接数据，但可用于对比不同免疫治疗策略下微生物组影响的异同及药物暴露的混杂效应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0139\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Immunotherapy resistance in non-small cell lung cancer: from mechanisms to therapeutic opportunities\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"详述色氨酸代谢途径中 IDO1 活性升高导致 T 细胞抑制及 Treg 分化的机制。提出补充特定益生菌（如双歧杆菌）及联合 IDO 抑制剂作为逆转 NSCLC 耐药的潜在策略，并补充肺部局部微生物群的作用视角。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0140\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut microbiome and metabolic health: mechanisms and precision interventions\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提供 LPS 介导 TLR4 激活导致系统性炎症及 SCFA 通过 GPR 受体调节宿主基因表达的通用机制。虽聚焦代谢疾病，但可作为理解微生物代谢物如何通过全身炎症环境间接影响肿瘤免疫微环境的背景参考。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0141\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Genetic heterogeneity of colorectal cancer and the microbiome\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"在结直肠癌中确认 Akkermansia、厚壁菌门与 ICI 疗效正相关，变形菌门与耐药相关。阐述丁酸盐抑制 HDAC 影响基因转录及细菌毒素诱导 DNA 损伤创造免疫抑制微环境的具体机制，强调分子亚型特异性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0142\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Optimizing Cancer Treatment Through Gut Microbiome Modulation\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"列举跨癌种有益菌（AKK, Faecalibacterium）及代谢物（肌苷、SCFA）证据。详述肌苷激活 A2A 受体及 SCFA 诱导 Th1/CTL 活化的机制。汇总正在进行中的 FMT 和工程菌临床试验，展示转化研究现状。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0143\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Impact of CBM588 on gut microbiome composition and dysbiosis in patients receiving frontline immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) combinations for metastatic renal cell carcinoma (mRCC).\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"展示益生菌 CBM588 在 mRCC 患者中阻止有益菌 Eubacterium siraeum 耗竭并改善 F/B 比率的早期临床数据。作为特定菌株逆转 ICI 诱导菌群失调的实证，支持通过维持关键菌丰度介导更好治疗反应的假设。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0144\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut Microbiome Control of Tumor Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor Response: Mechanistic Insights and Clinical Translation\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"梳理代谢物（SCFA、肌苷、色氨酸衍生物）通过特定受体（A2AR, AhR）重编程 T 细胞功能的机制。讨论 FMT 作为挽救疗法的短期有效性与长期不确定性，并指出当前研究在标准化和多中心验证方面的局限。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0145\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Microbiome-Gut-Liver Axis in Chronic Inflammation and Cancer Immunotherapy: Multi-omics Insights and a Translational Roadmap Toward Personalized Medicine.\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"聚焦肝癌，阐述菌群失调导致胆汁酸代谢改变及屏障受损引发全身炎症的机制。详述次级胆汁酸和色氨酸衍生物直接调控 T 细胞功能的分子路径，并提出多组学整合在解析微生物 - 免疫互作中的方法论价值。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut microbiota shapes cancer immunotherapy responses\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"全面映射菌群组成（AKK, 双歧杆菌）与疗效的关联及分子模拟、代谢物调节、TLS 重塑等机制。汇总 FMT、饮食及工程菌干预策略，同时强调癌种特异性、检测标准化缺失及供体效应等转化挑战。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0147\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Tumor associated depression, gut microbiota, and immune checkpoint inhibitor sensitivity\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提出心理因素（抑郁）通过 HPA 轴激活和色氨酸代谢途径抑制 T 细胞功能，进而间接影响 ICI 疗效的“肠 - 脑 - 免疫”轴机制。强调宿主心理状态作为微生物组 - 疗效关系中的重要混杂变量和潜在干预靶点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0148\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Response to immune checkpoint inhibition is associated with the gut microbiome in advanced KRAS-mutated non-small cell lung cancer\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"在 KRAS 突变 NSCLC 亚组中识别 SCFA 产生菌和 Akkermansia 与响应正相关。发现响应者中促炎通路（LPS、血红素合成）富集，挑战仅“健康菌群”有益的观点，提示炎症信号可能也是有效免疫激活的一部分。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0149\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Immune checkpoint inhibitor-induced myocarditis is dependent on CD8 T cell-derived TNF and TNFR2 signaling.\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"基于小鼠模型揭示 ICI 心肌炎由 CD8 T 细胞来源的 TNF 通过 TNFR2 信号介导，而非直接细胞毒性。作为非菌群依赖的全身免疫毒性机制案例，提示 ICI 不良反应可能涉及独立的细胞因子网络，需与菌群调节机制区分。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0150\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Understanding the role of the gut microbiome in solid tumor responses to immune checkpoint inhibitors for personalized therapeutic strategies: a review\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"汇总抗生素负面影响及 FMT/LBP 干预数据，特别分析 SER-401 试验因万古霉素预处理导致失败的教训。详述微生物组分（MDP, cdAMP）和代谢物通过 STING、NOD2 等通路调节免疫的具体分子机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0151\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Unraveling the gut microbiome's contribution to pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma: mechanistic insights and therapeutic perspectives\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"聚焦胰腺癌，阐述 TMAO 激活 I 型干扰素通路及 LPS 上调 PD-L1 的机制。讨论真菌 - 宿主相互作用及抗生素使用的矛盾结果，强调在“冷肿瘤”中微生物群通过改变免疫细胞浸润和代谢环境调节疗效的复杂性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0152\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Natural polysaccharides as immune adjuvants to overcome immune checkpoint inhibitor resistance: mechanistic insights, clinical evidence, and translational challenges\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"阐述天然多糖通过富集 Akkermansia/双歧杆菌及增加 SCFA 产生来增强抗肿瘤免疫的机制。详述多糖结构 motif 介导 TAM 重极化和逆转 T 细胞耗竭的分子路径，同时警示在失调肠道中过度发酵的潜在风险。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0153\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Abstract C065: Impact of polyethylene glycol bowel preparation on the gut microbiome composition and response to immune checkpoint inhibition\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提供 PEG 肠道准备导致 NSCLC 患者 PFS 缩短及小鼠模型中抗 PD-1 疗效削弱的证据。提出持续暴露破坏紧密连接蛋白并减少记忆 CD8+ T 细胞的机制，警示常规医疗操作可能作为负面调节因子干扰微生物组介导的疗效。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0154\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Symbiotic bacteria-mediated imbalance and repair of immune homeostasis: exploring novel mechanisms of microbiome-host interactions in atopic dermatitis\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"虽聚焦特应性皮炎，但提供共生菌通过 SCFA 和色氨酸衍生物调节 Th1/Th2/Treg 平衡及 AHR 通路的详细机制。作为非肿瘤背景下微生物组主动调节适应性免疫的平行案例，辅助解释微生物代谢物调控宿主免疫的通用原理。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0155\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Dietary compounds and patterns associated with immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) outcomes in advanced non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC).\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"在 NSCLC 中发现高脂低淀粉饮食与 PFS 改善相关，并富集 Ruminococcus lactaris 等有益菌；高淀粉饮食与 Prevotella 相关且预后较差。提供饮食模式通过重塑特定菌群进而影响 ICI 疗效及 irAEs 风险的观察性证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0156\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut microbiome changes and cancer immunotherapy outcomes associated with dietary interventions: a systematic review of preclinical and clinical evidence\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"系统综述高纤维饮食通过增加 Faecalibacterium 介导的 SCFA 产生增强免疫反应的证据。汇总禁食和生酮饮食在动物模型中的抗肿瘤效果，指出人类研究多为观察性且饮食评估工具异质性大的方法学局限。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0157\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Overcoming Resistance Mechanisms to Immune Checkpoint Inhibitors: Leveraging the Anti-Tumor Immune Response\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"详述抗原交叉反应、细胞因子诱导及代谢物调节三大机制。引用丁酸梭菌益生菌提高肾癌 ORR 及 FMT 在黑色素瘤中克服耐药的临床数据。警示抗生素、PPIs 和类固醇等合并用药通过破坏菌群平衡削弱疗效的风险。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0158\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Resistance mechanisms in melanoma to immuneoncologic therapy with checkpoint inhibitors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"聚焦黑色素瘤，确认 Raecalibacterium 和厚壁菌门与生存获益相关。提出细菌抗原模拟肿瘤新抗原诱导 DC 交叉呈递的机制假说，并指出益生菌可能降低多样性从而削弱疗效的争议性发现，强调情境依赖性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0159\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"The Association of Gut Microbiomes in Skin Cancer: Systematic Review and Meta–analysis\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"汇总皮肤癌中 Ruminococcaceae/Faecalibacterium 与抗 PD-1 响应正相关的证据。阐述“肠 - 皮轴”机制，包括 SCFA 调节全身炎症及局部皮肤微生物（如金葡菌）通过 IL-36a/IL-17 通路促进肿瘤进展的双向作用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0160\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"β-Catenin in Dendritic Cells Negatively Regulates CD8 T Cell Immune Responses through the Immune Checkpoint Molecule Tim-3\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"揭示 DC 表面 Tim-3 受 Wnt/β-catenin 信号负向调控并抑制 CD8 T 细胞反应的机制。虽未直接涉及微生物，但提供 APC 检查点分子作为 ICI 疗效关键决定因素的视角，支持联合靶向 DC 和 T 细胞检查点的理论基础。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0161\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Modulation of gut microbiota: a novel approach to enhancing the effects of immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"比较 FMT、益生菌和饮食三种策略的临床效果，指出 FMT 来自响应者可提高 ORR 而普通益生菌结果争议大。详述分子模拟、PRR 激活及代谢物调节等五种机制，强调菌株特异性和供体选择标准化的重要性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0162\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut microbiome-mediated primary and acquired resistance to immune checkpoint inhibitors in MSI-H/dMMR colorectal cancer: mechanisms, biomarkers, and therapeutic implications-a narrative review\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"构建 MSI-H/dMMR 结直肠癌中微生物介导的原发性和获得性耐药机制图谱。详述 SCFA、胆汁酸、色氨酸等五种代谢通路的双向调节作用，并提出从分类学标志物向功能性多组学标志物转化的必要性及挑战。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0163\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Intratumoral microbiota: implications for cancer progression and treatment\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"区分肠道菌群易位与瘤内定植的作用。详述 Fn 结合 TIGIT 抑制 NK/T 细胞及乳酸菌代谢物 ILA 增强 CD8+ T 细胞功能的机制。汇总 FMT 和工程菌（SYNB1891）激活 STING 通路以克服耐药的转化策略。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0164\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut Microbiota Biomarkers in Patients with Hepatocellular Carcinoma in the Era of Immune Checkpoint Inhibitors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"列举 HCC 中 Akkermansia/Faecalibacterium 与响应正相关及 E. coli/Veillonellaceae 与耐药相关的异质性证据。详述 SCFA、肌苷及色氨酸代谢物通过 HDAC 抑制和 AhR 通路调节免疫的分子机制，并指出机器学习模型跨队列验证的局限性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0165\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Exploring the regulatory mechanism of intestinal flora based on PD-1 receptor/ligand targeted cancer immunotherapy\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"梳理抗 PD-1 治疗中有益菌（AKK, 双歧杆菌）与耐药菌（Bacteroidales, Roseburia）列表。详述肌苷和 SCFA 增强 T 细胞杀伤力及细菌刺激 DC 成熟驱动 Th1 反应的机制，并补充特定菌群与 irAEs（如结肠炎）发生率的关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0166\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Immune checkpoint blockade induces gut microbiota translocation that augments extraintestinal anti-tumor immunity\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提供肠道细菌通过 DC 摄取并迁移至肠系膜淋巴结，进而重塑远端肿瘤免疫的物理机制证据。证明特定转移菌种（如 E. faecalis）的回补可恢复联合 ICI 疗效，填补“微生物存在”与“远端免疫反应”间的因果链条空白。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0167\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Health-related quality of life in cancer patients treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors in randomised controlled trials: A systematic review and meta-analysis.\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提供 ICI 相比化疗显著改善晚期实体瘤患者生活质量（QoL）和延缓临床恶化的荟萃分析数据。作为评估微生态干预最终临床获益的参照基准，强调在讨论微生物调节疗效时需兼顾生存期与患者报告结局的多维视角。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0168\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Advances in Immunotherapeutics in Pancreatic Ductal Adenocarcinoma\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"提供 PDAC 小鼠模型中抗生素清除微生物群增强 PD-1 抑制剂疗效的反直觉证据，描述 TME 中 CD8+ T 细胞浸润增加的表型。作为“冷肿瘤”中微生物群通过重塑免疫微环境影响疗效的特例，提示机制的肿瘤类型依赖性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0169\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Biomarkers for predicting the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"确认 Akkermansia、双歧杆菌等为跨癌种有益标志物。提出微生物通过增强 DC 功能和促进 CD8+ T 细胞浸润调节疗效的宏观机制框架。指出不同检测方法导致的命名和统计差异，强调需结合宿主免疫状态综合解读。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0170\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Enterotype-specific microbial biomarkers of immune checkpoint inhibitor response revealed by large-scale integrated metagenomic analysis\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"发现 Collinsella 在肠杆菌科富集的肠型中与响应相关，而 Bacteroides 在另一肠型中起作用，揭示微生物标志物的群落背景依赖性。指出单一物种标志物在不同研究中表现不一的原因在于其作用受整个微生态环境制约。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"The gut microbiome and response to immune checkpoint inhibitors: preclinical and clinical strategies\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"系统列出 Akkermansia、双歧杆菌等有益菌和 Bacteroidales、E. coli 等耐药菌。详述 DC 成熟、T 细胞募集及 Treg 调节机制。讨论采样方法、测序技术及抗生素使用等混杂因素导致的研究异质性，强调标准化必要性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0172\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"From mechanisms to precision medicine: the role of organoids in studying the gut microbiota-tumor microenvironment axis\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"综述类器官模型揭示菌群失调与 MHC-I 表达降低及 CD8+ T 细胞浸润减少的关联。详述微生物代谢物通过 AhR 受体及 Wnt/β-catenin 通路调节免疫检查点的机制，同时指出类器官缺乏完整免疫组分的方法学局限。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0173\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut microbiota-metabolism axis in digestive tumors: Emerging targets for novel therapies (Review)\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"聚焦消化肿瘤，确认 Akkermansia、双歧杆菌为有益菌。详述 SCFA 通过 HDAC 抑制及次级胆汁酸通过 FXR/TGR5 受体重塑 TME 的机制。指出丁酸盐在缺氧 TME 中可能促进肿瘤生存的双向作用，强调情境依赖性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0174\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"The role of the gut microbiota in tumor, immunity, and immunotherapy\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"汇总跨癌种有益/有害菌列表及抗生素负面影响。详述 SCFA 抑制 HDAC、细菌抗原激活 TLR/NF-κB 及 STING 通路激活的分子机制。总结 FMT 从响应者 rescue 非响应者的临床数据，同时指出生物标志物缺乏共识的现状。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0175\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"The Challenges Faced by Immune Checkpoint Inhibitors and Strategies to Enhance Their Efficacy\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"列举 Akkermansia、Lachnospiraceae 等有益菌及 Eggerthellaceae 等耐药菌。提出高微生物密度增强细胞因子分泌的假设。汇总 FMT 克服黑色素瘤耐药及饮食/益生菌辅助策略，强调需与其他生物标志物联合使用以提高预测准确性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0176\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Metabolism and Immune Modulation in Patients with Solid Tumors: Systematic Review of Preclinical and Clinical Evidence\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"汇总 Akkermansia、E. hirae 与 PFS 延长相关的临床证据及抗生素使用的负面影响。阐述双歧杆菌补充剂协同抗 PD-L1 及拟杆菌特异性 T 细胞反应介导 CTLA-4 疗效的机制，强调微生物组嵌入宿主代谢网络的复杂性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0177\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Modulation of the response to immunotherapy in triple-negative breast cancer: the role of the microbiota and microbial metabolites in the tumor microenvironment\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"聚焦三阴性乳腺癌，确认 Akkermansia、双歧杆菌与 ICI 响应正相关。详述 TMAO 诱导免疫原性细胞死亡及 SCFA 作为 HDAC 抑制剂调节表观遗传的机制。强调低生物量样本污染风险及因果验证缺乏的方法学挑战。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0178\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"The gut microbiome as an actionable drug-sensitivity modulator for immune checkpoint blockade: clinical evidence for FMT, live biotherapeutics, and defined consortia\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH01\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH04\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"对比 FMT、LBPs 和定义菌群三类干预的临床证据，指出 FMT 在难治性黑色素瘤中的概念验证效力。提出“生态药理学”框架，解释基线生态、抗生素预处理及饮食对干预结果的决定性影响，并警示 FMT 的感染风险。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0179\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"Gut microbial structural variation associates with immune checkpoint inhibitor response\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH02\",\n        \"CH03\",\n        \"CH05\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"发现 Akkermansia 等关键菌种的结构变异（SVs）独立于物种丰度与 ICI 疗效相关。提出 SV 区域富集糖代谢和免疫调节基因（如唾液酸酶）的机制假设，论证亚基因组水平分析在揭示微生物功能多样性中的必要性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_handle\": \"P0180\",\n      \"paper_title\": \"The gut microbiome–bile acid-FXR interplay: a pivotal axis in metabolic and gastrointestinal diseases\",\n      \"chapter_ids\": [\n        \"CH03\"\n      ],\n      \"specific_usable_material\": \"详述微生物胆汁酸（3-oxo-LCA, isoalloLCA）通过调节 RORγt 和 NR4A1 影响 Th17/Treg 平衡的分子机制。虽聚焦代谢病，但提供微生物代谢物作为信号分子远程精细调节宿主免疫细胞表型的通用原理，辅助解释 ICI 疗效的潜在机制。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to route a batch of 60 sources (P0121-P0180) to a shared outline for a review on \"How does the gut microbiome modulate the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in solid tumours, and what mechanisms mediate that effect?\"\n\nThe shared outline has 5 chapters:\n- CH01: Clinical evidence landscape (antibiotics, FMT trials, observational data)\n- CH02: Microbial features (predictive taxa and metabolites)\n- CH03: Mechanistic pathways (immune, metabolic, barrier function)\n- CH04: Therapeutic interventions (FMT, probiotics, diet clinical feasibility)\n- CH05: Limitations, heterogeneity, and translational research directions\n\nI need to read each source's B planning card and assign it to appropriate chapter(s) based on its actual content, research type, object, conditions, and depth. I must write specific_usable_material in Chinese (80-150 characters) for each source, indicating what specific facts or comparative angles are usable and their purpose in the review.\n\nLet me go through each source systematically:\n\nP0121: HCC patients, 16S sequencing, Faecalibacterium (beneficial) vs Bacteroidales (harmful) with ICI PFS. Observational, retrospective, HCC-specific. Good for CH02 (microbial features) and CH01 (clinical evidence in specific tumor type).\n\nP0122: MET4 bacterial consortium trial, IgG responses, immune remodeling. Phase I/II, safety/colonization not efficacy. Good for CH04 (interventions) and CH03 (mechanisms - immune remodeling).\n\nP0123: NSCLC, metagenomics, taxonomic and metabolic pathways with PFS and PD-L1. Observational. Good for CH02 (taxa and metabolic pathways) and CH01 (clinical evidence).\n\n\nP0124: 2026 review on mechanisms (inosine, SCFAs, intratumoral microbes). Good for CH03 (mechanisms) and CH05 (limitations/context).\n\nP0125: MRx0518 Phase I/II trial abstract, ICI-refractory patients. No efficacy data yet. Good for CH04 (interventions - ongoing trials) and CH05 (limitations - early stage)